<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n59124" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κόρις</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ιος</span>, 
			Att.
		
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εως</span>, ὁ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>bug, Cimex lectularius</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἱ κόρεις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Nu.</u>
					634
				</span></i>
			 (with a play on <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Κορίνθιοι</span>,
			cf. <i><span class="en">
				710
			</span></i>), <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ra.</u>
				115
			</span></i>, al.: also fem., <i><span class="en">
				Sor.
				2.29
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Phryn.
				277
			</span></i> (acc. to <i><span class="en">
				Suid.
			</span></i> with gen. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κόριδος</span>, wh. is
			not found in Classical Gr., cf. [<i><span class="en">
				Gal.
			</span></i>] <i><span class="en">
				14.538
			</span></i>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> kind of
				<i>fish</i>, 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔσχαρος</span>
			, Dorioap. <i><span class="en">
				Ath.
				7.330a
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b> a kind of
				<i>St. John's wort, Hypericum empetrifolium</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				3.157
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Aët.
				16.17
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
